# Test Subscription & Branding APIs

## Health Check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Create Subscription (Starter Plan)
POST http://localhost:4000/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "test-tenant-123",
  "planTier": "starter"
}

### Get Subscription
GET http://localhost:4000/subscriptions?tenantId=test-tenant-123

### Get Usage Stats
GET http://localhost:4000/subscriptions/usage?tenantId=test-tenant-123

### Get Bill
GET http://localhost:4000/subscriptions/bill?tenantId=test-tenant-123

### Upgrade Plan to Growth
PUT http://localhost:4000/subscriptions/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "test-tenant-123",
  "newPlanTier": "growth"
}

### Get Branding
GET http://localhost:4000/tenant/branding?tenantId=test-tenant-123

### Update Branding
POST http://localhost:4000/tenant/branding
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "test-tenant-123",
  "businessName": "Mama Cass Kitchen",
  "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png",
  "primaryColor": "#FF6B35"
}

### Cancel Subscription
DELETE http://localhost:4000/subscriptions?tenantId=test-tenant-123
